---
description: >-
  Same forward-position central connection (circle at destination only) on
  the "normal" arrow family as the "-left-to-right" sibling, but with
  Bob/Charlie as senders so messages flow right-to-left.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Bob->>()Alice: Solid arrow with circle at destination (RTL)
  Charlie-->>()Bob: Dotted arrow with circle at destination (RTL)
  Bob->()Alice: Open arrow with circle at destination (RTL)
  Charlie--x()Alice: Cross arrow with circle at destination (RTL)
  Bob--)()Alice: Close arrow with circle at destination (RTL)
